  <button class="export-btn" onclick="exportPNG()">Export PNG</button>

  <div class="poster-wrapper" id="poster">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="poster-header">
      <div class="venue-tag">The Lancet Digital Health &nbsp;·&nbsp; AI in Clinical Medicine Symposium</div>
      <div class="poster-title">Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Decision-Making:<br>Performance, Safety, and Implementation Gaps</div>
      <div class="poster-subtitle">A synthesis of current evidence on AI-assisted clinical decision support systems — diagnostic accuracy gains, safety considerations, and the translational gap from research to bedside deployment.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- BODY -->
    <div class="poster-body">

      <!-- KEY METRICS -->
      <div class="metrics-row">
        <div class="metric-card anchor">
          <div class="metric-value">&lt;5%</div>
          <div class="metric-label">Published AI models reaching prospective clinical validation</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-value" style="color:#1d4ed8;">87.5%</div>
          <div class="metric-label" style="color:#475569;">AI median diagnostic sensitivity<br><span style="color:#94a3b8;">(vs. 78.2% clinician-only)</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card warning">
          <div class="metric-value">18%</div>
          <div class="metric-label">Studies reporting formal<br>demographic bias assessment</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-value" style="color:#0891b2;">32%</div>
          <div class="metric-label" style="color:#475569;">Reduction in diagnostic<br>turnaround time with AI</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-value" style="color:#1d4ed8;">93.1%</div>
          <div class="metric-label" style="color:#475569;">AI median specificity<br><span style="color:#94a3b8;">(vs. 91.4% clinician)</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-value" style="color:#0891b2;">692</div>
          <div class="metric-label" style="color:#475569;">FDA regulatory-cleared<br>AI/ML medical devices (2023)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TWO COLUMNS: PERFORMANCE + SAFETY -->
      <div class="two-col">

        <!-- LEFT: DIAGNOSTIC PERFORMANCE -->
        <div>
          <div class="section-title">Diagnostic Performance</div>
          <div class="section-block">
            <div class="callout-box">
              <p>Across <strong>400+ studies</strong>, AI-assisted workflows achieved a median sensitivity of <strong>87.5%</strong> vs. <strong>78.2%</strong> for clinician-only — a <strong>+9.3 pp gain</strong>. Largest improvements in imaging specialties using deep learning.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="sensitivity-section" style="margin-top:14px;">
              <div style="font-size:11px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#475569;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:bold;">Sensitivity by Domain (%)</div>
              <div class="sensitivity-bars">

                <div class="compare-pair">
                  <div class="compare-label">Radiology</div>
                  <div class="bar-group">
                    <div class="bar-row">
                      <div class="bar-fill ai" style="width:calc(89.3% - 38px)"></div>
                      <div class="bar-pct ai-val">89.3%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bar-row">
                      <div class="bar-fill clinician" style="width:calc(79.8% - 38px)"></div>
                      <div class="bar-pct cli-val">79.8%</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="compare-pair">
                  <div class="compare-label">Dermatology</div>
                  <div class="bar-group">
                    <div class="bar-row">
                      <div class="bar-fill ai" style="width:calc(86.7% - 38px)"></div>
                      <div class="bar-pct ai-val">86.7%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bar-row">
                      <div class="bar-fill clinician" style="width:calc(76.5% - 38px)"></div>
                      <div class="bar-pct cli-val">76.5%</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="compare-pair">
                  <div class="compare-label">Ophthalmol.</div>
                  <div class="bar-group">
                    <div class="bar-row">
                      <div class="bar-fill ai" style="width:calc(90.1% - 38px)"></div>
                      <div class="bar-pct ai-val">90.1%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bar-row">
                      <div class="bar-fill clinician" style="width:calc(82.3% - 38px)"></div>
                      <div class="bar-pct cli-val">82.3%</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="compare-pair">
                  <div class="compare-label">Pathology</div>
                  <div class="bar-group">
                    <div class="bar-row">
                      <div class="bar-fill ai" style="width:calc(84.0% - 38px)"></div>
                      <div class="bar-pct ai-val">84.0%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bar-row">
                      <div class="bar-fill clinician" style="width:calc(74.1% - 38px)"></div>
                      <div class="bar-pct cli-val">74.1%</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

              </div>
              <div class="bar-legend">
                <span><span class="legend-dot" style="background:#1d4ed8;"></span>AI-assisted</span>
                <span><span class="legend-dot" style="background:#94a3b8;"></span>Clinician-only</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT: SAFETY & EQUITY -->
        <div>
          <div class="section-title">Safety, Bias &amp; Health Equity</div>
          <div class="safety-items">
            <div class="safety-item">
              <div class="safety-icon">⚠️</div>
              <div class="safety-text">Only <strong>18%</strong> of studies formally assessed algorithmic bias across demographic groups — a critical equity gap.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="safety-item">
              <div class="safety-icon">📊</div>
              <div class="safety-text">Among studies that assessed bias, <strong>5–12 percentage-point sensitivity disparities</strong> were documented for underrepresented populations, especially in dermatology AI trained on lighter skin tones.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="safety-item">
              <div class="safety-icon">🔬</div>
              <div class="safety-text">Adverse safety events attributable to AI were reported in <strong>&lt;1% of prospective trials</strong>, but under-reporting is widely suspected due to absent standardised frameworks.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="safety-item" style="background:#fff0f0;border-color:#fca5a5;">
              <div class="safety-icon">🚨</div>
              <div class="safety-text"><strong>No standardised safety-reporting framework</strong> for AI-CDSS exists — a critical structural gap analogous to pre-pharmacovigilance era drug monitoring.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- IMPLEMENTATION GAP + RECOMMENDATIONS -->
      <div class="two-col">

        <!-- LEFT: IMPLEMENTATION GAP -->
