          <div class="section-title">Translational Implementation Gap</div>
          <div class="callout-box" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fef2f2 0%,#fff7ed 100%);border-left-color:#ef4444;">
            <p>The FDA has cleared <strong>692</strong> AI/ML-enabled medical devices, yet <strong>fewer than 5%</strong> of AI models published in peer-reviewed literature have ever undergone prospective real-world validation. Research promise rarely reaches the bedside.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:14px;">
            <div style="font-size:11px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#475569;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:bold;">Key Implementation Barriers</div>
            <div class="barriers-grid">
              <div class="barrier-chip">Data infrastructure fragmentation</div>
              <div class="barrier-chip">Regulatory uncertainty</div>
              <div class="barrier-chip">Clinician trust deficit</div>
              <div class="barrier-chip">Limited economic evidence</div>
              <div class="barrier-chip">Workflow misalignment</div>
              <div class="barrier-chip">Interoperability gaps</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT: RECOMMENDATIONS -->
        <div>
          <div class="section-title">Recommendations &amp; Future Directions</div>
          <div class="rec-list">
            <div class="rec-item">
              <div class="rec-num">1</div>
              <div class="rec-text"><strong>Mandate prospective validation</strong> before clinical deployment — multi-site, diverse-population trials.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rec-item">
              <div class="rec-num">2</div>
              <div class="rec-text"><strong>Standardise bias auditing</strong> via demographic-stratified reporting as a publication requirement.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rec-item">
              <div class="rec-num">3</div>
              <div class="rec-text"><strong>Develop shared safety registries</strong> analogous to pharmacovigilance systems for AI-CDSS.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rec-item">
              <div class="rec-num">4</div>
              <div class="rec-text"><strong>Invest in interoperability</strong> through open standards (FHIR, OMOP) to enable data sharing.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rec-item">
              <div class="rec-num">5</div>
              <div class="rec-text"><strong>Prioritise explainability research</strong> to build clinician and patient trust in AI-augmented care.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div><!-- end poster-body -->

